    cineris-tui secret::tests::a_paste_with_a_control_character_is_refused_whole
    cineris-tui secret::tests::auth_login_at_a_terminal_empties_on_ctrl_u_and_keeps_nothing_of_a_refused_paste

[break] a-pasted-line-is-refused-for-its-end
rule: One line break at the very end of a paste, which a line copied with its end brings, is dropped rather than refusing the paste.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/secret.rs
in: KeyInput::paste
find: self.buffer.push_str(without_line_end(text))
replace: self.buffer.push_str(text)
