    cineris-tui secret::tests::auth_login_at_a_terminal_empties_on_ctrl_u_and_keeps_nothing_of_a_refused_paste

[break] a-paste-loses-every-line-break-at-its-end
rule: Only one line break at the very end of a paste is dropped: a paste that ends in two is two lines, and is refused whole.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/secret.rs
in: without_line_end
find: .unwrap_or(text)
replace: .unwrap_or(text).trim_end_matches(['\n', '\r'])
caught-by:
    cineris-tui secret::tests::a_pasted_line_loses_its_one_line_break_at_the_end

[break] a-pasted-crlf-leaves-its-carriage-return
rule: A paste that ends in `\r\n` loses both: a line copied on Windows ends in one line break of two characters.
file: crates/cineris-tui/src/secret.rs
in: without_line_end
find: text.strip_suffix("\r\n")
replace: text.strip_suffix("\n\r")
caught-by:
    cineris-tui secret::tests::a_pasted_line_loses_its_one_line_break_at_the_end

[break] a-dropped-key-buffer-is-not-written-over
rule: Dropping the key's buffer writes zeros over every byte of it.
file: crates/cineris-base/src/secret_buf.rs
in: SecretBuf::drop
find: wipe(&mut self.bytes);
replace: let _ = &mut self.bytes;
caught-by:
    cineris-base secret_buf::tests::a_dropped_buffer_leaves_every_byte_zero

[break] a-keys-buffer-holds-more-than-64-kib
